// D&D 5e reference data (SRD-based subset). Structured so the wizard and the
// manual sheet both read from the same source. Extend the arrays below to add
// more races/classes/backgrounds/spells over time — nothing else needs to change.
//
// NOTE on editions: 2014 races carry fixed ability bonuses; 2024 moved ability
// bonuses to Backgrounds (races instead grant Darkvision/size/speed/traits only).
// Where a field differs between editions it's kept on the entry itself
// (e.g. race.abilityBonuses is only used when edition === '2014').

